#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "List or filter backends {#list-or-filter-backends}"
msgstr "Buat daftar atau filter backend {#list-or-filter-backends}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"available\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"available\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "List backends available to you {#list-backends-available-to-you}"
msgstr "Buat daftar backend yang tersedia untukmu {#list-backends-available-to-you}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can use either Qiskit or IBM Quantum Platform to view a list of backends available to you, or to search for a particular backend.\n"
msgstr "Kamu bisa pakai Qiskit atau IBM Quantum Platform untuk melihat daftar backend yang tersedia untukmu, atau untuk mencari backend tertentu.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"QPU names\">\n"
"QPUs hosted on IBM Cloud&reg; have names that begin with `ibm_*`. All QPUs are given a city name - for example, `ibm_kingston`. This name does not indicate where the actual QPU is hosted.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Nama QPU\">\n"
"QPU yang dihosting di IBM Cloud&reg; punya nama yang dimulai dengan `ibm_*`. Semua QPU diberi nama kota - misalnya, `ibm_kingston`. Nama ini tidak menunjukkan di mana QPU yang sebenarnya dihosting.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"Qiskit-available\" label=\"View backends with Qiskit\">\n"
"        Use the [`QiskitRuntimeService.backends()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#backends) method, as shown in the next code block. This method returns a list of [`IBMBackend`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/ibm-backend) instances.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"Qiskit-available\" label=\"Lihat backend dengan Qiskit\">\n"
"        Gunakan metode [`QiskitRuntimeService.backends()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#backends), seperti yang ditunjukkan di blok kode berikutnya. Metode ini mengembalikan daftar instance [`IBMBackend`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/ibm-backend).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "        To run the following code, be sure you have already authenticated to the service. See [Set up your IBM Cloud account](/guides/cloud-setup) for more details.\n"
msgstr "        Untuk menjalankan kode berikut, pastikan kamu sudah terautentikasi ke layanan. Lihat [Siapkan akun IBM Cloud kamu](/guides/cloud-setup) untuk detail lebih lanjut.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "        To search for a specific backend, use the [`QiskitRuntimeService.backend()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#backend) method (note that this is singular: *backend*), which takes the name of the backend as the input parameter and returns an [`IBMBackend`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/ibm-backend) instance representing that particular backend:\n"
msgstr "        Untuk mencari backend tertentu, gunakan metode [`QiskitRuntimeService.backend()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#backend) (perhatikan bahwa ini tunggal: *backend*), yang menerima nama backend sebagai parameter input dan mengembalikan instance [`IBMBackend`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/ibm-backend) yang merepresentasikan backend tertentu tersebut:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    </TabItem>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"IQP-available\" label=\"View backends on IBM Quantum Platform\">\n"
"        To view the backends you have access to, navigate to the list of backends on the [Compute resources page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) (note that your selected region might impact the QPUs listed). Click the filter icon and choose either \"All my instances\" or a specific instance name to see the available QPUs.\n"
"    </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"    </TabItem>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"IQP-available\" label=\"Lihat backend di IBM Quantum Platform\">\n"
"        Untuk melihat backend yang bisa kamu akses, buka daftar backend di [halaman Compute resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) (perhatikan bahwa wilayah yang kamu pilih mungkin mempengaruhi QPU yang terdaftar). Klik ikon filter dan pilih \"All my instances\" atau nama instance tertentu untuk melihat QPU yang tersedia.\n"
"    </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"   If you are logged in to a specific instance or region, or if you initialized the service with a specific instance or region by using `QiskitRuntimeService()`, only the backends available to you on that instance or region are returned.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"   Jika kamu login ke instance atau wilayah tertentu, atau jika kamu menginisialisasi layanan dengan instance atau wilayah tertentu menggunakan `QiskitRuntimeService()`, hanya backend yang tersedia untukmu di instance atau wilayah tersebut yang dikembalikan.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Filter backends {#filter-backends}"
msgstr "Filter backend {#filter-backends}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"Qiskit-filter\" label=\"Filter by properties with Qiskit\">\n"
"        You can filter the available backends by their [configuration](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/models-backend-configuration) or [status](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/models-backend-status). For more general filters, set the `filters` argument to a function that accepts a backend object and returns `True` if it meets your criteria. Refer to the [API documentation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#backends) for more details.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"Qiskit-filter\" label=\"Filter berdasarkan properti dengan Qiskit\">\n"
"        Kamu bisa memfilter backend yang tersedia berdasarkan [konfigurasi](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/models-backend-configuration) atau [status](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/models-backend-status)-nya. Untuk filter yang lebih umum, atur argumen `filters` ke fungsi yang menerima objek backend dan mengembalikan `True` jika memenuhi kriteriamu. Lihat [dokumentasi API](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#backends) untuk detail lebih lanjut.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "        The following code returns only backends that fit these criteria and are available to you _on your currently selected instance_:\n"
msgstr "        Kode berikut hanya mengembalikan backend yang sesuai dengan kriteria ini dan tersedia untukmu _di instance yang sedang kamu pilih_:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '        *   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Are real quantum devices (`simulator=False`)\n"
msgstr "Merupakan perangkat kuantum nyata (`simulator=False`)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '        *   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Are currently operational (`operational=True`)\n"
msgstr "Sedang operasional (`operational=True`)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '        *   '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Have at least a hundred qubits (`min_num_qubits=100`)\n"
msgstr "Memiliki setidaknya seratus qubit (`min_num_qubits=100`)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "        A similar method is [`QiskitRuntimeService.least_busy()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#least_busy), which takes the same filters as `backends()` but returns the backend that matches the filters and has the least number of jobs pending in the queue:\n"
msgstr "        Metode serupa adalah [`QiskitRuntimeService.least_busy()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-service#least_busy), yang menerima filter yang sama dengan `backends()` tetapi mengembalikan backend yang cocok dengan filter dan memiliki jumlah pekerjaan tertunda paling sedikit dalam antrean:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    </TabItem>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"IQP-filter\" label=\"Filter by properties on IBM Quantum Platform\">\n"
"        To view the backends you have access to, view the table on the [Compute resources page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers). Click the filter icon to see filter options. You can filter by processor type and status. Note also that you can sort the table by any column by hovering over a column title, and then clicking the arrows that appear.\n"
"    </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"    </TabItem>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"IQP-filter\" label=\"Filter berdasarkan properti di IBM Quantum Platform\">\n"
"        Untuk melihat backend yang bisa kamu akses, lihat tabel di [halaman Compute resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers). Klik ikon filter untuk melihat opsi filter. Kamu bisa memfilter berdasarkan jenis prosesor dan status. Perhatikan juga bahwa kamu bisa mengurutkan tabel berdasarkan kolom mana pun dengan mengarahkan kursor ke judul kolom, lalu mengklik panah yang muncul.\n"
"    </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Static backend information {#static-backend-information}"
msgstr "Informasi backend statis {#static-backend-information}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Some information about a backend does not change regularly, such as its name, [version](#qpu-versioning), the number of qubits it has, its processor type (the bird family name, which indicates the [topology](#coupling-map) and approximate qubit count), and the types of features it supports. This information is available as attributes of the `backend` object. For a full list of attributes, see the [`IBMBackend` API documentation](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/ibm-backend).  Find more information on versioning in the [QPU versioning](#qpu-versioning) section below.\n"
msgstr "Beberapa informasi tentang backend tidak berubah secara rutin, seperti namanya, [versi](#qpu-versioning), jumlah qubit yang dimilikinya, jenis prosesornya (nama keluarga burung, yang menunjukkan [topologi](#coupling-map) dan perkiraan jumlah qubit), dan jenis fitur yang didukungnya. Informasi ini tersedia sebagai atribut dari objek `backend`. Untuk daftar lengkap atribut, lihat [dokumentasi API `IBMBackend`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/ibm-backend). Temukan informasi lebih lanjut tentang pemberian versi di bagian [Versi QPU](#qpu-versioning) di bawah.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A backend's region (the location of the data center where your data and experiments will be hosted and processed) is listed in its detailed information card on the [Compute resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) page on IBM Quantum Platform.\n"
msgstr "Wilayah backend (lokasi pusat data tempat data dan eksperimenmu akan dihosting dan diproses) terdaftar di kartu informasi detailnya di halaman [Compute resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) di IBM Quantum Platform.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"Qiskit-backend\" label=\"View backend information with Qiskit\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<Tabs>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"Qiskit-backend\" label=\"Lihat informasi backend dengan Qiskit\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  </TabItem>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"IQP-backend\" label=\"View backend information on IBM Quantum Platform\">\n"
msgstr ""
"  </TabItem>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"IQP-backend\" label=\"Lihat informasi backend di IBM Quantum Platform\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    Navigate to the [Compute resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) page to view a table of all QPUs, then click the name of any QPU to open its detailed information card. Find backend information under the Details section of the card.\n"
msgstr "    Buka halaman [Compute resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) untuk melihat tabel semua QPU, lalu klik nama QPU mana saja untuk membuka kartu informasi detailnya. Temukan informasi backend di bagian Details kartu tersebut.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"  </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "QPU versioning {#qpu-versioning}"
msgstr "Versi QPU {#qpu-versioning}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each QPU has a version number in the form X.Y.Z (major.minor.revision). A circuit compiled for a given version number is guaranteed to run on that QPU. If the revision number changes, the circuit will continue to run. If the major or minor number changes, the circuit is not guaranteed to run, although it may do so.\n"
msgstr "Setiap QPU memiliki nomor versi dalam format X.Y.Z (major.minor.revision). Circuit yang dikompilasi untuk nomor versi tertentu dijamin bisa berjalan di QPU tersebut. Jika nomor revision berubah, circuit akan tetap bisa berjalan. Jika nomor major atau minor berubah, circuit tidak dijamin bisa berjalan, meskipun mungkin saja bisa.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The revision version number will increment for fixes that do not break the existing compiled circuit.\n"
msgstr "Nomor versi revision akan bertambah untuk perbaikan yang tidak merusak circuit yang sudah dikompilasi.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The code example earlier in [this section](#static-backend-information) demonstrates how to find a backend's version. On IBM Quantum Platform, you can view the version on a QPU's detailed information card (click the QPU's name on the [Compute resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) table to open the card).\n"
msgstr "Contoh kode sebelumnya di [bagian ini](#static-backend-information) menunjukkan cara menemukan versi backend. Di IBM Quantum Platform, kamu bisa melihat versi pada kartu informasi detail QPU (klik nama QPU di tabel [Compute resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) untuk membuka kartunya).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The conditions under which a version or revision number can change are listed in the following table.\n"
msgstr "Kondisi-kondisi di mana nomor versi atau revision dapat berubah terdaftar di tabel berikut.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Major version | Minor version | Revision version |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"|Sample changes| Warmup / cool-down cycles | QPU software updates |\n"
"|Major changes to the control electronics| Swapping out some electronics, if the replacement appreciably affects operation| Manual calibrations to improve fidelities |\n"
"|Moving the QPU to a new location, if significant behavior changes result| Dropping a gate for some duration of time due to calibration issues, and corrections cannot readily be done in software| Small electronics changes that don’t affect operation |\n"
"| |Changing the direction of a CNOT gate | |\n"
"<span id=\"native-gates-ops\"></span>\n"
msgstr ""
"| Versi major | Versi minor | Versi revision |\n"
"| --- | --- | --- |\n"
"|Perubahan sampel| Siklus pemanasan / pendinginan | Pembaruan perangkat lunak QPU |\n"
"|Perubahan besar pada elektronik kontrol| Mengganti sebagian elektronik, jika penggantian tersebut secara nyata mempengaruhi operasi| Kalibrasi manual untuk meningkatkan fidelitas |\n"
"|Memindahkan QPU ke lokasi baru, jika menghasilkan perubahan perilaku yang signifikan| Menghapus Gate untuk jangka waktu tertentu karena masalah kalibrasi, dan koreksi tidak dapat dengan mudah dilakukan dalam perangkat lunak| Perubahan kecil pada elektronik yang tidak mempengaruhi operasi |\n"
"| |Mengubah arah Gate CNOT | |\n"
"<span id=\"native-gates-ops\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Supported instructions {#supported-instructions}"
msgstr "Instruksi yang didukung {#supported-instructions}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Each [processor family](/guides/processor-types) natively supports a limited set of instructions. This set includes single- and two-qubit gates, as well as non-unitary operations such as measure and reset. Every gate in the circuit must be translated (by the transpiler) to the elements of a QPU's supported instruction set before it can run on the QPU.\n"
msgstr "Setiap [keluarga prosesor](/guides/processor-types) secara native mendukung set instruksi yang terbatas. Set ini mencakup Gate satu- dan dua-qubit, serta operasi non-unitary seperti measure dan reset. Setiap Gate dalam circuit harus diterjemahkan (oleh transpiler) ke elemen-elemen set instruksi yang didukung QPU sebelum bisa berjalan di QPU.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "You can view the supported instruction sets for a QPU with Qiskit. The IBM Quantum Platform Compute resources page lists only the supported unitary gates (basis gates) for a QPU.\n"
msgstr "Kamu bisa melihat set instruksi yang didukung untuk QPU dengan Qiskit. Halaman Compute resources IBM Quantum Platform hanya menampilkan Gate unitary yang didukung (Gate basis) untuk QPU.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  <Tabs>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"Qiskit-native\" label=\"Find supported instructions with Qiskit\">\n"
msgstr ""
"  <Tabs>\n"
"  <TabItem value=\"Qiskit-native\" label=\"Temukan instruksi yang didukung dengan Qiskit\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    </TabItem>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"IQP-basis\" label=\"Find basis gates on IBM Quantum Platform\">\n"
msgstr ""
"    </TabItem>\n"
"    <TabItem value=\"IQP-basis\" label=\"Temukan Gate basis di IBM Quantum Platform\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    Navigate to the [Compute resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) page to view a table of all QPUs, then click the name of any QPU to open its detailed information card. The basis gates for that QPU are listed in the Details section.\n"
"    </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"
msgstr ""
"    Buka halaman [Compute resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) untuk melihat tabel semua QPU, lalu klik nama QPU mana saja untuk membuka kartu informasi detailnya. Gate basis untuk QPU tersebut terdaftar di bagian Details.\n"
"    </TabItem>\n"
"</Tabs>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"native-gates\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"native-gates\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Table of supported instructions {#table-of-supported-instructions}"
msgstr "Tabel instruksi yang didukung {#table-of-supported-instructions}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"| Operation category |  Name |\n"
"| :--- | :--- |\n"
"| Single-qubit gates | [`RZ`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.RZGate), [`SX`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.SXGate), [`X`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.XGate), [`ID`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.IGate), [`delay`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#qiskit.circuit.Delay) |\n"
"| Two-qubit gates | [`CZ`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.CZGate), [`ECR`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.ECRGate)|\n"
"| Fractional gates | [`RX`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.RXGate) (single-qubit), [`RZZ`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.RZZGate) (two-qubit) |\n"
"| Non-unitary instructions | [`measure`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#qiskit.circuit.Measure), [`reset`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#qiskit.circuit.Reset), [`measure_*`](/guides/execute-dynamic-circuits#midcircuit), [`delay`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#delay) |\n"
"| Control flow | [`if_else`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.IfElseOp) (classical feedforward) |\n"
msgstr ""
"| Kategori operasi |  Nama |\n"
"| :--- | :--- |\n"
"| Gate satu-qubit | [`RZ`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.RZGate), [`SX`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.SXGate), [`X`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.XGate), [`ID`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.IGate), [`delay`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#qiskit.circuit.Delay) |\n"
"| Gate dua-qubit | [`CZ`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.CZGate), [`ECR`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.ECRGate)|\n"
"| Gate fraksional | [`RX`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.RXGate) (satu-qubit), [`RZZ`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.library.RZZGate) (dua-qubit) |\n"
"| Instruksi non-unitary | [`measure`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#qiskit.circuit.Measure), [`reset`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#qiskit.circuit.Reset), [`measure_*`](/guides/execute-dynamic-circuits#midcircuit), [`delay`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#delay) |\n"
"| Control flow | [`if_else`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.IfElseOp) (classical feedforward) |\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Dynamic backend information {#dynamic-backend-information}"
msgstr "Informasi backend dinamis {#dynamic-backend-information}"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Backends also have properties that change whenever the backend is calibrated, such as qubit lifetime and operation error rates. Backend properties update after the calibration sequence completes. These properties can be used when optimizing quantum circuits or to construct noise models for a classical simulator. See the [Calibration jobs](/guides/calibration-jobs) guide for more information.\n"
msgstr "Backend juga memiliki properti yang berubah setiap kali backend dikalibrasi, seperti lifetime qubit dan tingkat error operasi. Properti backend diperbarui setelah urutan kalibrasi selesai. Properti ini bisa digunakan saat mengoptimalkan circuit kuantum atau untuk membangun model noise bagi simulator klasik. Lihat panduan [Pekerjaan kalibrasi](/guides/calibration-jobs) untuk informasi lebih lanjut.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "On IBM Quantum Platform, you can download calibration data as a CSV file. Click a QPU on the [Compute resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) page to view its detailed information card, then click the download icon in the upper right corner of the Calibration data section.\n"
msgstr "Di IBM Quantum Platform, kamu bisa mengunduh data kalibrasi sebagai file CSV. Klik QPU di halaman [Compute resources](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/computers) untuk melihat kartu informasi detailnya, lalu klik ikon unduh di sudut kanan atas bagian Calibration data.\n"

