#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<span id=\"t1\"></span>\n"
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"`T1` (Relaxation time)\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<span id=\"t1\"></span>\n"
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"`T1` (Waktu relaksasi)\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The $T_1$ time represents the average duration a qubit remains in its excited state $|1\\rangle$ before decaying to its ground state $|0\\rangle$ due to energy relaxation. This parameter is used to characterize the qubit's energy relaxation behavior, and is expressed in units of seconds (s).\n"
msgstr "Waktu $T_1$ mewakili rata-rata durasi qubit tetap berada dalam keadaan tereksitasinya $|1\\rangle$ sebelum meluruh ke keadaan dasarnya $|0\\rangle$ karena relaksasi energi. Parameter ini digunakan untuk mengkarakterisasi perilaku relaksasi energi qubit, dan dinyatakan dalam satuan detik (s).\n"

