"    </tr>\n"
"  </tbody>\n"
"</table>\n"
"</AccordionItem>\n"
"<span id=\"2q-error-median\"></span>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Median error 2Q (Heron: CZ, Eagle: ECR)\">\n"

# doq: mechanical transfer from the previous translation
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "  [Average gate fidelity](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/quantum_info#average_gate_fidelity) of the two-qubit operation from randomized benchmarking. Measured in \"isolation\": batches with a minimum separation of two qubits between edges. This randomized benchmarking uses alternating layers of single-qubit Cliffords and two-qubit gates, and thus the final 2Q error value includes the error of the layer of single-qubit Cliffords.\n"
msgstr "[Rata-rata fidelitas Gate](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/quantum_info#average_gate_fidelity) dari operasi dua-qubit dari randomized benchmarking. Diukur secara \"terisolasi\": batch dengan pemisahan minimum dua qubit antar edge. Randomized benchmarking ini menggunakan lapisan bergantian dari Clifford satu-qubit dan Gate dua-qubit, sehingga nilai error 2Q akhir mencakup error lapisan Clifford satu-qubit.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
